				'To access the method, the following permission is required customer_read . Returns the changes in customer data, which were made in the specified range of dates, or the set of incremental changes for carrying out the permanent synchronization The result is returned per-page. In the field pagination there is an information about the pagination. To paginate through history records, it is necessary to use filter[sinceId] . It is not recommended to use the page parameter. More information about the work with history you can find in other article .',
